{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/927397-actual-play-home-is-where-the-bones-are","id":927397,"title":"Actual Play: Home Is Where The Bones Are","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-06T19:05:33-07:00","id":927397,"title":"Actual Play: Home Is Where The Bones Are","content":"Hey all! This is a shameless, shameless plug for an AP that I've recently posted to rpg.net - <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?785380-Werewolf-the-Forsaken-Home-Is-Where-The-Bones-Are\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...-The-Bones-Are</a><br /> <br /> If you're looking for the blurb at the back of the book, it's pretty simple:<div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><i><b>Home Is Where The Bones Are</b><br /> A First Change Story, wherein a couple of teens find out that their rural Arkansas family has a fair few skeletons in the closet, and a lot of enemies circling.</i></div> <br /> It's been a lot of fun so far! We're about five sessions in, and I'll be posting session two later today. Hope you like it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T04:54:12-07:00","id":927553,"title":"","content":"Session Two is up! It has First Change-hangovers, arguments with parents, and a touch of silver. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T05:26:07-07:00","id":929670,"title":"","content":"Session 3's up, if people are interested! <br /> <br /> It's got runaways, a snacks run that doesn't work out, and a great example of the complications of high Harmony!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-14T17:21:30-07:00","id":931708,"title":"","content":"Just posted Session 4, too - wherein our two pups meet another werewolf and some spirits. Only ONE of these want to kill them!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T21:06:57-07:00","id":934892,"title":"","content":"Session 5, done and dusted! We've got a PC that hasn't been in it since session one, joined by an all-new PC (who's - gasp! - not even from the family!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T04:48:52-07:00","id":936024,"title":"","content":"Session 6 is up, and we're still following the two newer PCs. School's out and they've been under a bit of stress lately, so what do they do? Get themselves beaten up, nearly kill some kids, and go to church! Fun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T22:38:42-07:00","id":939355,"title":"","content":"Next session is live! We're back to following the Uratha, who are on their first Hunt! They both approach it in pretty different ways, too, which is quite interesting. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T20:51:46-07:00","id":955394,"title":"","content":"Next session is (finally!) up!! Sorry for the delay, but this is the conclusion to the brothers' first Siskur-Dah, wherein there are a) brutally-murdered humans, b) brutally-murdered spirits (well, one), and c) a handful of eyes (literally). Good times were had by all!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-12T16:34:16-08:00","id":1047982,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the serious Thread Necromancy, but another couple of sessions have been posted over at <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?785380-Werewolf-the-Forsaken-Home-Is-Where-The-Bones-Are&amp;p=20808199#post20808199\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...9#post20808199</a><br /> <br /> The first episode sees the boys officially join Tribes, while the second sees a potential Big Bad revealed, a family reunion of sorts, and an end-of-season cliffhanger! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T06:02:18-08:00","id":1053775,"title":"","content":"And we're back with the first session of the new season, wherein the pack a) deals with the fallout from last episode, b) attempts to cling to some semblance of a normal life, and c) fears for the innocent that may have been irrevocably changed by their rampage.<br /> <br /> (Fun times!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T20:40:36-07:00","id":1093519,"title":"","content":"Any updates on this now that you have gotten the DE companion out the door?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T18:28:45-07:00","id":1093933,"title":"","content":"Unfortunately, we've had <i>disruption </i>after <i>disruption </i>lately! I think that the RPG.net thread has seen one or two updates that I haven't posted about here, but no - it's been a <i>loooooong </i>time since we last actually played. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Thanks for the reminder, though, and I'll see whether I can rustle up some players to play again soon. In the meantime, if you're interested, I've got a Spotify playlist of inspirational music you may enjoy: <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/user/1232167434/playlist/7AgCHn214U1XSEgjFQsD5b\" target=\"_blank\">https://open.spotify.com/user/123216...4U1XSEgjFQsD5b</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T18:34:58-07:00","id":1093936,"title":"","content":"And thanks for the shout-out re: the Dark Eras Companion, too. My part of that was finished a looooong time ago now, though, so I was just waiting as (im-)patiently as everybody else for it to finally drop. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Now that it has, though, I keep returning to it and gazing at all the pretty pictures based on our ideas. MUCH LIKE.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T20:28:28-07:00","id":1125777,"title":"","content":"Hey all, sorry for the necromancy, but I've updated the Actual Play again! If you're interested, there have been a few sessions posted since I last mentioned it here: <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?785380-Werewolf-the-Forsaken-Home-Is-Where-The-Bones-Are\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...-The-Bones-Are</a><br /> <br /> More to come shortly, too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T22:38:29-07:00","id":1130723,"title":"","content":"But wait, there's more - <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?785380-Werewolf-the-Forsaken-Home-Is-Where-The-Bones-Are&amp;p=21309841#post21309841\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...1#post21309841</a><br /> <br /> There isn't too much action in this session, but there's a hell of a lot of revelations spread across two more pieces of flash-fiction: <i>Pays-the-Price</i> and <i>The Last Day</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T12:08:59-07:00","id":1130921,"title":"","content":"I don't post much, but I do have to say that I've been happily reading along with these play sessions! A lot of the little nuances you've done with Gifts and Renown-reveal are things I'd like to try in my new game coming up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T19:12:54-07:00","id":1131065,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the kind words! I'm glad you're enjoying it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Yeah, I really enjoyed those little tidbits too. I wouldn't want to do it for *every* new Gift or Renown increase, but it really does add a lot to the experience, huh?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T21:07:55-07:00","id":1142807,"title":"","content":"UPDATE! We've had, like, three sessions since I last posted (sorry!), which you can find starting <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?785380-Werewolf-the-Forsaken-Home-Is-Where-The-Bones-Are&amp;p=21359432#post21359432\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Quite a bit happens, including:<br /> <br /> - Dean and Anastasia go on an adventure to T-Town (it ends...badly? Maybe?),<br /> - Matthew and Jamie go Toad Busting (I'd say it makes sense in context, but I'm not sure that it does), and<br /> - Jamie goes on an Initiation of sorts... (<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance OPP. <b>Dark Eras</b>, <b>Shattered Dreams</b>, and counting!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2653-nated","name":"NateD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}